{
    "description": "Types of signals of the physio files, from the labels of their recording entity (recording-<label>) and from the Columns of their JSON sidecars. Names are compared in lower case and without their trailing digits (ECG2 is ecg, eye1 is eye); for columns, the words of their names are compared too (Zyg - EMG100C is emg). A name can be of several types (respcardiac). Unknown recording labels are of type 'other', unknown columns (time...) are ignored.",
